  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build 4 solar facilities making use of existing preratory work of IRC-WASH in the Ahafo region. Project Maji will prepare the site selection, outline designs and affordability checks in association with IRC-WASH</narrative>
