    <baseline year="2020"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <actual value="Under this co-creation pilot to accelerate sustainable access to safe water in rural Ghana, we have installed 6 solar-powered water kiosks in 3 communities in the Ahafo Region. In total we have distributed 480 tokens, providing safe drinking water to 2880 individual users. We reached a total of 6880 people with access to safe drinking water (JMP Basic level) within 500 meters or a 30 minute round trip. Three Caretakers have been recruited to sell the water and they receive 20% of the sales revenue. The project can be maintained by local parties and is financially sustainable, meaning that the operating costs (Opex) are mostly covered by the revenues. Governmental staff is sufficiently informed of the initiative&apos;s intentions and its relevant components, we have received strong endorsement from the District assembly in Asunafo South."></actual>
    </period>
